{"id":"wb-3-15","name":"刘少奇故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"刘少奇故居","text":"刘少奇故居，坐落在湖南省长沙市宁乡市花明楼镇，是已故前中华人民共和国主席刘少奇的诞生地。现已辟为长沙市主要旅游景点，第一批国家一级博物馆，是国家5A级旅游景区的花明楼景区重要构成部分。它距离韶山毛泽东故居20公里，距离宁乡市城区35公里。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%98%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%87%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":93939519,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93939519","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c4a833afbd2c225772234f3c.jpg","title":"Liu_Shaoqi's_former_residence_2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liu_Shaoqi%27s_former_residence_2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2b/Liu_Shaoqi%27s_former_residence_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"huangdan2060","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​刘少奇故居，位于湖南省长沙市宁乡县花明楼镇。","width":320,"height":240}}